<title>USA: U.S. meat output up 18.0 pct from week ago-USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. meat output up 18.0 pct from week ago-USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Red meat production for week</p>
<p>ending Saturday, Jan 11, rose 18.0 pct at 803.6 million lbs.-USDA</p>
<p>WEEK ENDING/1  BEEF   CALF/VEAL   PORK/2 LAMB/MUTTON TOTALS/3</p>
<p>11-Jan-97	484.0     6.7	308.8     4.1	803.6</p>
<p>04-Jan-97	391.7     5.4	280.0     3.8	680.9</p>
<p>Change:	   23.6%   24.1%	10.3%    7.9%     18.0%</p>
<p>13-Jan-96	492.2     6.0	355.6     4.6	858.4</p>
<p>Change:	   -1.7%   11.7%     -13.2%  -10.9%     -6.4%</p>
<p>1997 YTD:	714.8     9.4	459.7     5.9     1189.8</p>
<p>1996 YTD:	925.2    11.8	658.6     9.0     1604.6</p>
<p>Change:	  -22.7%  -20.3%     -30.2%  -34.4%    -25.9%</p>
<p>LIVESTOCK SLAUGHTER (HEAD)</p>
<p>WEEK ENDING   CATTLE   CALVES/VEALERS     HOGS     SHEEP/LAMBS</p>
<p>11-Jan-97     713,000	33,000     1,635,000	63,000</p>
<p>04-Jan-97     577,000	26,000     1,483,000	58,000</p>
<p>Change:	  23.6%	  26.9%	   10.2%	  8.6%</p>
<p>13-Jan-96     694,000	 28,000     1,891,000	72,000</p>
<p>Change:	   2.7%	  17.9%	  -13.5%	-12.5%</p>
<p>1997 YTD:     1,053,000     46,000     2,434,000	91,000</p>
<p>1996 YTD:*    1,298,000     57,000     3,510,000     142,000</p>
<p>Change:	 -18.9%	  -18.6%	  -30.6%	-36.0%</p>
<p>*1996 slaughter totals adjusted to reflect NASS revisions</p>
<p>AVERAGE WEIGHTS (LBS.)</p>
<p>WEEK ENDING  LIVE CATTLE   CALVES/VEALERS   HOGS  SHEEP/LAMBS</p>
<p>11-Jan-97    Est    1162	 355	    260	  131</p>
<p>04-Jan-97    Est    1163	 355	    260	  132</p>
<p>13-Jan-96    Actual 1198	 363	    258	  127</p>
<p>Dressed</p>
<p>11-Jan-97    Est     682	 207	    189	   65</p>
<p>04-Jan-97    Est     682	 209	    189	   65</p>
<p>13-Jan-96    Actual  713	 213	    189	   63</p>
<p>FOR THE WEEK PERCENTAGE OF TOTAL CATTLE SLAUGHTERED BY CLASS</p>
<p>ENDING	 STEERS	HEIFERS     COWS     BULLS &amp; STAGS</p>
<p>28-Dec-96     46.8%	 31.7%	20.3%	  1.3%</p>
<p>30-Dec-95     51.6%	 29.5%	17.7%	  1.3%</p>
<p>FOR THE WEEK PERCENTAGE OF TOTAL HOGS SLAUGHTERED BY CLASS ENDING	BARROWS &amp; GILTS	    SOWS     STAGS &amp; BOARS</p>
<p>28-Dec-96     97.0%			2.6%	   0.4%</p>
<p>30-Dec-95     96.1%			3.3%	   0.6%</p>
<p>*1996 slaughter totals adjusted to reflect NASS revisions. NOTE: 1996 YTD reflects six production days. 1997 YTD reflects four production days</p>
